    "content" : "My mom rented a helicopter for my parent&#39;s 34th anniversary/Father&#39;s day/crossing something off of my dad&#39;s bucket list. Our neighbor allowed him to land in his yard (You can see my parent&#39;s house in the background) so we felt like celebrities walking from the house into a helicopter. We had an hour in the air and were able to fly over Pittsburgh (takes 45 minutes in a car, but not that long going 140mph in a straight line) and some local sights like relative&#39;s houses. It was a ton of fun and I hope I have the chance to do something like that again.",
    "objectType" : "note",
    "originalContent" : "My mom rented a helicopter for my parent's 34th anniversary/Father's day/crossing something off of my dad's bucket list. Our neighbor allowed him to land in his yard (You can see my parent's house in the background) so we felt like celebrities walking from the house into a helicopter. We had an hour in the air and were able to fly over Pittsburgh (takes 45 minutes in a car, but not that long going 140mph in a straight line) and some local sights like relative's houses. It was a ton of fun and I hope I have the chance to do something like that again.",
